  "head": {
    "text": "spi2neopixel_bridge - snoop mode: chip listens to PSRAM reads on the Pmod bus"
  },
  "foot": {
    "text": "Not to scale. Precondition: CONFIG 01h with bit 5 = 1. Each burst is a new PSRAM read (CE# low <= tCEM). MCU CS_n stays high while DWIN is high. Pmod SCK <= clk/4, SD sampled on rising edge, high nibble first."
  },
  "config": {
    "hscale": 2
  }
